OL,3,GNEWSAUS man found guilty of British
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of the
OL,7,Fkidnap and first-degree murder of a
OL,8,Fwoman who he groomed on a fetish
OL,9,Fwebsite.
OL,11,FDwain Hall, 54, convinced 32-year-old
OL,12,FSonia Exelby from Southsea, Hampshire,
OL,13,Fto travel to the United States where he
OL,14,Fstabbed her to death.
OL,16,FHe was found guilty following a trial
OL,17,Fat a court in Ocala, Florida, of kidnap
OL,18,Fand murder.
